1
00:00:00,423 --> 00:00:03,053
(Beverly:)You're an extraordinary woman.
Thank you.

2
00:00:03,059 --> 00:00:05,429
(Penny:)You know, she's
my mother-in-law.

3
00:00:05,428 --> 00:00:07,158
(Penny:)Why can't I bond
with her like that?

4
00:00:07,163 --> 00:00:10,563
(Bernadette:)Amy's with Sheldon
who she loves like a son.

5
00:00:10,566 --> 00:00:12,396
(Bernadette:)You're with her son...

6
00:00:12,402 --> 00:00:15,172
(Bernadette:)who she doesn't.

7
00:00:15,171 --> 00:00:18,201
(Amy:)Do you realize it took me five
years to get a massage from him?

8
00:00:18,207 --> 00:00:21,877
(Beverly:)Oh, well, that still could be
a big step for Sheldon.

9
00:00:21,878 --> 00:00:23,878
(Amy:)Three minutes.

10
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:26,880
(Amy:)And he used a kitchen timer.

11
00:00:26,883 --> 00:00:29,313
(Amy:)I felt like a soft-boiled egg.

12
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:32,820
(Penny:)You know, being in a
relationship with Leonard

13
00:00:32,822 --> 00:00:34,952
(Penny:)also comes
with its challenges.

14
00:00:34,958 --> 00:00:36,288
(Sheldon:)Yes.

15
00:00:36,292 --> 00:00:39,662
(Beverly:)Well, what can you do?

16
00:00:39,662 --> 00:00:41,632
(knocking on door)

17
00:00:43,132 --> 00:00:45,202
(Amy(knock on door):)Maybe it's Sheldon,
here to say he's sorry.

18
00:00:45,201 --> 00:00:48,031
(Stuart:)Sheldon says he's sorry.

19
00:00:51,007 --> 00:00:53,277
(Amy:)Bernadette, I'll give you
five dollars to slam the door.

20
00:00:53,276 --> 00:01:01,026
(Stuart:)I would have done
it for three.

